# Normalise line endings in the working tree. A Windows/WSL clone with core.autocrlf=true
# otherwise gets CRLF in files that are parsed line-by-line — and a CR turns every pattern in
# `.companion/da-paths` into `…\r`, which matches nothing and SILENTLY disables the R78 gate.
# `da-gate.sh` strips CR defensively; this prevents the class rather than one instance (R81/R78).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bats text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
da-paths text eol=lf
